# Ronin, Shadow Stalker: "{T}, Sacrifice an Equipment attached to Ronin: ... Activate only as a sorcery." (CR 307.5, 602.5d). On
# turn 3 Bot1 equips Bark of Doran to Ronin with Ronin's own restricted mana. With the equip ability still on the stack the
# sacrifice ability is refused (the stack is not empty), and so it is in the end step (not a main phase): Ronin is untapped, Bark
# still attached, and both stay (the success is in the scenario with the Raging Goblin).

